OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 7 JAN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Copland
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod follows Copland's
OL,6,     Gquest for a music that speaks of
OL,7,     GAmerica.
OL,8,G1700FIn Tune
OL,9,     GChinese pipa virtuoso and
OL,10,     Gcomposer Gao Hong joins Katie
OL,11,     GDerham to play live music from
OL,12,     Gher new album.
OL,13,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,14,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,15,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,16,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,17,     GThe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,18,     GWales performs an arrangement of
OL,19,     GSchumann's Marches, Franck's only
OL,20,     Gextant symphony, and Finzi's
OL,21,     GClarinet Concerto with Nicholas
OL,22,     GCarpenter as soloist.
